//! The `transition-property` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets
//! the CSS properties to which a [transition
//! effect](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Transitions/Using) should be
//! applied.
//!
//! Initial: all. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - all: All properties that can transition will.
//! - none: No properties will transition.
//!
//! Grammar: none | <single-transition-property>#
